  "actor_notes": "Pell Nettles\nLOOKS: Wiry adult in a rain-grey coat, with a yellow scarf tucked at the throat and quick narrow hands. No visible weapon.\nCORE: A local crowd thief who treats festivals as harvest and believes getting greedy is how professionals get caught.\nNATURE: Cheerful, alert, and proud of clean work. Likes crowds and dislikes enclosed rooms.\nWOUND: An old arrest cost Pell a year and two fingertips; uniforms and locked doors now end every argument.\nWANTS: One good purse before the crowd thins.\nPRESSURE: Runs immediately, discards the take, and lies only if escape is blocked.\nKEY: \"Wasn't your purse, was it?\"",
